{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43247","headline":"初日照华清宫 · 柴宿","name":"初日照华清宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵山初照泽，远近见离宫。\n影动参差里，光分缥缈中。\n鲜飙收晚翠，佳气满晴空。\n林润温泉入，楼深复道通。\n璇题生烱晃，珠缀引𦝰胧\n凤辇何时幸，朝朝此望同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柴宿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}